      "username": "MigrantP",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-25T20:20:02.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yep, that's the idea. Suppose you were in this situation on the table top. You would just ignore the hero targets, not even considering doing them damage, even though you could. Since our screen real estate is limited, we want to make the most of it by focusing on the actions you're most likely to want to do. And if you do want to damage a hero, you still can, by showing all targets and selecting one.</p>",
      "post_number": 5,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:37:09.829Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
