      "raw": "<p>Multiple targets are most likely to be sequential &quot;choose a target&quot; steps, because the available targets can change in between damage dealing. It would also be more difficult to show the calculations/effects for many targets at once.</p><p>If you&#39;re damaging all targets, or all targets of a certain class (e.g. all non-hero targets), then you&#39;re essentially choosing the order in which they will be damaged. In that case, there will be an &quot;I don&#39;t care&quot; button (or similar) that just does all the damage in whatever order. Most of the time that&#39;s ok, but some times you&#39;ll want to carefully choose the order.</p>",
