      "raw": "[quote=\"MigrantP\"]\n\nYep, that&#39;s the idea. Suppose you were in this situation on the table top. You would just ignore the hero targets, not even considering doing them damage, even though you could.\n\n[/quote]\n\nYou are mostly correct, but I love to target me some Fixer with mantis out.&nbsp; If he has mantis, crowbars, and harmony, targeting an enemy and himself redirecting that damage to the same enemy he targeted hitting it for two shots of two damage each is a fantastic thing to behold.\n",
