      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-27T18:33:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>For sure, and of course Absolute Zero often likes to target himself. That's why the option is available. You can do anything in the digital version that you can in the table top game =)</p><p>Though as a side note, I don't think that combo works exactly, since&nbsp;Driving Mantis only works for 2 or less damage. If you have Dual Crowbars and Harmony in play, you're doing 3 damage minimum. Unless you have a point of damage reduction from some other effect.</p>",
