      "created_at": "2014-06-27T21:57:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't think so, because Driving Mantis has to wait until Mr. Fixer \"would be dealt\" damage. It is not allowed to take effect until all the other damage modifiers are considered.</p><p>We're working on a blog post that goes into our damage dealing algorithm (which we worked out with the help of Christopher), but the key here is that redirects cannot be ordered ahead of non-redirects.</p>",
