      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/silverleaf/{size}/2332_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-06-28T18:43:18.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Looks nice, but for me the \"bullet icon x 4\" format feels wrong. It's highly suggestive of multiple hits (because in any other situation you'd read it as \"you have four shots/bullets/attacks) which of course isn't the case. We say \"4 projectile damage\" not \"4 times projectile damage\".</p><p>I'd much prefer \"4 bullet icon\". It reflects the game wording better and doesn't imply multiples.&nbsp;</p>",
